        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "For example, we are subject to numerous laws, directives, and regulations regarding privacy, data protection, and data security and the collection, storing, sharing, use, processing, transfer, disclosure, and protection of personal information and other data.",
